@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = paste-token-from-login-here

### 健康检查：无需登录
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 登录演示账号
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Fullstack123!"
}

### 当前用户：把上一个响应中的 token 复制到文件顶部
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 项目列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建项目
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "我的全栈练习",
  "description": "通过接口理解 Controller 和 Service"
}

### 查询项目任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks?status=todo&priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

